{
 "name": "kestrel_fc",
 "title": "Kestrel H7 - FPV flight controller: STM32H743, dual IMU, baro, 16 MB blackbox, 5 V + 10 V BECs, 2-6S",
 "revision": "A",
 "brief": "A 40 x 40 mm, 6-layer flight controller on the 30.5 mm stack for a 5-inch 6S FPV quad. STM32H743VIT6 (480 MHz) with an 8 MHz crystal; ICM-20602 on SPI1 (Betaflight's gyro) and BMI088 on SPI4 (the second IMU for INAV and ArduPilot), both on their own 3.3 V LDO; MS5611 barometer on I2C1; W25Q128 16 MB blackbox on SPI3. Power from the ESC harness (2-6S, SMAJ30A TVS): LMR51430 BECs for 5 V / 2 A and a switchable 10 V / 2 A for a digital VTX (Betaflight PINIO). JST-SH ports for a 4-in-1 ESC (8-pin: VBAT, GND, CURR, TLM, M1-M4), a DJI O3 / Walksnail / HDZero VTX (6-pin), an ELRS receiver (4-pin) and a GPS + compass (6-pin); USB-C for configuration and DFU; pads for motors 5-8, two spare UARTs, an LED strip and a buzzer. Pin map after the MATEKH743 target.",
